ent-ClothingEyesGlassesJanitor = janitorial scanner goggles
    .desc = Highlights the shapes of loose trash and puddles through walls within eight metres using a thermal imaging palette. Wear them over your eyes and use the scanner action to toggle detection.
ent-ActionToggleJanitorVision = Toggle janitorial scanner
    .desc = Toggles thermal-style highlighting of nearby loose trash and puddles through walls.
